# The virtual-background images were once committed through git-lfs, and a
# checkout without the lfs extension installed leaves 130-byte pointer stubs in
# their place. Nothing failed loudly — the background processor catches its own
# image load error — so the two image options in meet's settings silently did
# nothing. These are ordinary binary files now; keep them that way.
*.jpg -text -filter -diff -merge
*.jpeg -text -filter -diff -merge
*.png -text -filter -diff -merge
*.ico -text -filter -diff -merge
*.woff2 -text -filter -diff -merge
